WEBVTT

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.256
that I would invite you
to consider as well.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:34.616
So if you need to move in
with your brother to make ends meet,

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:35.976
call him.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:41.496
If you need to take in a boarder
to help you pay your mortgage

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.016
or pay your rent,

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.256
do it.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.616
If you need to get food stamps,

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:48.576
get the darn food stamps.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:54.440
AARP says only a third of older adults
who are eligible actually get them.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:58.720
Do what you need to do
to go another round.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:03.136
Know that there are millions of us.